  Note over Nurse,PatientAccount: ✅ 予約票・診察券の確認
  Nurse->>CheckInScreen: ✅ 予約票・診察券の確認
  CheckInScreen->>VerifyArrivalApi: ✅ 予約票・診察券の確認
